      "extract": "Let (X1,...,Xn) be a random vector in Rn with distribution μ. We study rates of approximation of the average marginal distribution function F(x) = EFn(x) = 1 n n \u0002 i=1 P{Xi ≤x} by the empirical distribution function Fn(x) = 1 n card{i ≤n:Xi ≤x}, x ∈R. We shall measure the distance between F and Fn by means of the (uniform) Kolmogorov metric ∥Fn −F∥= supx |Fn(x) −F(x)|, as well as by means of the L1-metric W1(Fn,F) =",
